OL,3,GNEWSAKillers jailed for life over teen
OL,4,Afather's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who murdered a 19-year-old
OL,7,Ffather with large "fearsome knives" in
OL,8,Fa violent attack have been jailed for
OL,9,Flife.
OL,11,FTobias Agbaje, 21, of Herne Bay, and
OL,12,FKieron Barnes, 20, of no fixed address,
OL,13,Fattacked Ashton Harrington in
OL,14,FWhitstable on 3 April. The teenager was
OL,15,Funarmed.
OL,17,FEmergency services found Harrington had
OL,18,Fstopped breathing and had suffered
OL,19,Fmultiple stab wounds. He died at the
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
