OL,3,GNEWSAKillers jailed for life over teen
OL,4,Afather's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Canterbury Crown Court, Judge Simon
OL,7,FJames ordered Agbaje to serve a minimum
OL,8,Fterm of 25 years and Barnes at least 22
OL,9,Fyears, minus time already spent in
OL,10,Fcustody.
